lass=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\bigl((\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to\\alpha+1\\leq\\beta)\\land0+\\alpha=\\alpha\\land\\alpha+0=\\alpha\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Ordinal addition is not commutative.</li>\n<li>For ordinals, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\beta\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\)</span> is equivalent to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha+1\\leq\\beta\">\\(\\alpha+1\\leq\\beta\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic.md","status":"resolved","id":"d74493bfaf9bf48a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-ordinal-arithmetic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\alpha,\\beta$ (ordinals, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}ordinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\to\\bigl((\\alpha<\\beta\\to\\alpha+1\\leq\\beta)\\land0+\\alpha=\\alpha\\land\\alpha+0=\\alpha\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha+1\\leq\\beta","display":false}